# Native overhead sanity check

Three release-mode processes per mode; each executes the same arithmetic loop. `inactive` calls the facade without a capture and `active` records one instant per iteration. Initialization and trace readout are outside `elapsed_ns`; process CPU/RSS include them. This is a regression sanity check, not an AudioWorklet or hardware-independent claim.

